{"code":"BL27","wikidata":"Q4919752","wikipedia":{"en":"Phahon Yothin MRT station","th":"สถานีพหลโยธิน (รถไฟฟ้ามหานคร)"},"summary":{"en":"Phahon Yothin station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Blue Line located under Lat Phrao Road and Phahon Yothin Road, which the station is named after, near Lat Phrao intersection. The station is important for people who live in Northern Bangkok such as the Don Mueang, Lak Si and Bang Khen districts. Its symbol color is   yellow.","th":"สถานีพหลโยธิน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนลาดพร้าว กรุงเทพมหานคร บริเวณห้าแยกลาดพร้าว"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_platforms_%282%29.jpg/960px-Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_platforms_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_platforms_(2).jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/MRT_BEM_PHA.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_BEM_PHA.png","author":"Oum13928","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/MRT_BN6.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_BN6.png","author":"Oum13928","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_-_concourse_level.jpg/960px-Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_-_concourse_level.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phahon_Yothin_MRT_Station_-_concourse_level.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedi